<<<
no need whatever to say forceful instead of the natural forcible:— Certainly he was a forceful & impressive personality at a time when the stature of international statesmen was not particularly great.
===
no need whatever to say *forceful* instead of the natural *forcible*:—*Certainly he was* a forceful & impressive personality *at a time when the stature of international statesmen was not particularly great.*
>>>

